OL,3,AFather's house rammed before son died
OL,4,Ain A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house rammed by a car before the
OL,7,Ffatal A66 crash in Middlesbrough
OL,8,Fbelonged to the father of a teenager
OL,9,Fwho died in the incident.
OL,11,FCole Worthy, 17, was one of five young
OL,12,Fmen who died when a Volkswagen Passat
OL,13,Ftravelling in the wrong direction hit a
OL,14,FCleveland Police armed response
OL,15,Fvehicle, also killing two police
OL,16,Fofficers.
OL,18,FBefore the crash at 03:39 BST on
OL,19,FSaturday, police had received multiple
OL,20,Freports of two cars driving dangerously
OL,21,Faround the town and a Volvo XC60 was
OL,22,Fseen ramming properties.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
