OL,3,AYellow weather warnings issued as
OL,4,Athunderstorms and flooding forecast
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile good news for regions plagued by
OL,7,Fdrought, significant accumulations
OL,8,Fcould lead to flash flooding where the
OL,9,Fground is too dry and hard to absorb
OL,10,Fthe downpours. Lightning, large hail
OL,11,Fand gusty winds are also possible.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
