OL,3,AChina hits out at 'illegal' new US
OL,4,Asanctions on Iran and trading partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina has vowed to protect its
OL,7,Finterests after the US announced plans
OL,8,Fto widen economic sanctions against
OL,9,FIran and its trading partners, which
OL,10,Finclude Beijing.
OL,12,FForeign ministry spokesman Lin Jian
OL,13,Fsaid China was firmly opposed to what
OL,14,Fit called "illegal unilateral
OL,15,Fsanctions" and would take "all
OL,16,Fnecessary measures" to safeguard its
OL,17,Frights.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
